{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1492135-tc-phoebe-trust-psions-in-modern-times","id":1492135,"title":"[TC] Phoebe Trust - Psions in modern times","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-09-01T22:17:00-07:00","id":1492135,"title":"[TC] Phoebe Trust - Psions in modern times","content":"Official non-canonical small era is on DriveThru - <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/405547?affiliate_id=13&amp;src=OnyxPathWeds\" target=\"_blank\">Phoebe Trust</a></b><br /> <br /> So let's talk about it... I do get it right that <b><i>Trust</i> Safehouses are <i>Aeon</i>'s era protoOrder headquarters</b> and in 2120s they will take over most of respective continents? They will also develop proper Nodes and Aptitude in time? But for now, Safehouses general influences is 'just' largest cities in area of future psions Orders?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-02-2022, 04:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-02T01:33:30-07:00","id":1492145,"title":"","content":"Having both Psions and Psiads will be an unpredictable element. As the development of Psions goes along more predictable lines than Psiads, the Psions will likely dominate the proto-orders. <br /> <br /> You might need a specifically Psiad organisation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-02T01:48:06-07:00","id":1492146,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t think the safe houses have any thing related to Order HQ, they are just evenly distributed over the world, North America, South America, Europe and Asia, sure, Africa and Oceania are missing, but you can\u2019t cover 6 continents without 6 safe houses. They don\u2019t even have related aptitude to work as anything related to the orders or control the available \u201cpsion factories\u201d.<br /> <br /> I think the idea here is how they fit the continuum if you want to make them into your game. Does it change the future?<br /> in my view, Phoebe Trust can be a Psion allegiance in core and not disturb the timeline at all, just for a lack of viable time.<br /> - In the 70-80s they were too few to organize properly.<br /> - In the 90-00s, wen they start to gain momentum with more Psions and inner movements to operate openly there was still the fear in the air, trying to run from their captors and the captors adversaries.<br /> - In early 10s when the inner movement start to be meaningful they may try to become public in a \u201csafe way\u201d by infiltrating the government an all. But suddenly the Novas are a thing and they were confused as Novas, as were Psiads and overt Talents.<br /> - Later they become a foot note instead of the leaders behind puppets. With Novas, the investments on psychic research goes to 0, Aberrant War made people afraid of people with powers and than we have Aeon.<br /> <br /> To be fair, the existence of Phoebe Trust would explain why the leaders of UN were ok with the \u201cmysterious benefactors\u201d of the Psi Orders, as there were registers of people researching and after 150+ years they would have learned how to make Psions more effective, except it was not the case, it was an soft alien invasion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 09-02-2022, 04:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-02T12:20:49-07:00","id":1492181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1492135-tc-phoebe-trust-psions-in-modern-times?p=1492146#post1492146\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don\u2019t think the safe houses have any thing related to Order HQ, they are just evenly distributed over the world, North America, South America, Europe and Asia, sure, Africa and Oceania are missing, but you can\u2019t cover 6 continents without 6 safe houses. They don\u2019t even have related aptitude to work as anything related to the orders or control the available \u201cpsion factories\u201d.<br /> <br /> I think the idea here is how they fit the continuum if you want to make them into your game. Does it change the future?<br /> in my view, Phoebe Trust can be a Psion allegiance in core and not disturb the timeline at all, just for a lack of viable time.<br /> - In the 70-80s they were too few to organize properly.<br /> - In the 90-00s, wen they start to gain momentum with more Psions and inner movements to operate openly there was still the fear in the air, trying to run from their captors and the captors adversaries.<br /> - In early 10s when the inner movement start to be meaningful they may try to become public in a \u201csafe way\u201d by infiltrating the government an all. But suddenly the Novas are a thing and they were confused as Novas, as were Psiads and overt Talents.<br /> - Later they become a foot note instead of the leaders behind puppets. With Novas, the investments on psychic research goes to 0, Aberrant War made people afraid of people with powers and than we have Aeon.<br /> <br /> To be fair, the existence of Phoebe Trust would explain why the leaders of UN were ok with the \u201cmysterious benefactors\u201d of the Psi Orders, as there were registers of people researching and after 150+ years they would have learned how to make Psions more effective, except it was not the case, it was an soft alien invasion.</div> </div> </div> </div>This could definitely work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-05T10:03:20-07:00","id":1492373,"title":"","content":"So basically, the idea is that Advanced or Inspired Science is used instead of Promethean Chambers to activate Latents as Psions; but these \u201chomegrown processes\u201d aren't as good at it as Promethean Chambers will be; and as a result, the psions they produce have drawbacks that their \u00c6on-era counterparts will lack, and lack one feature that their future counterparts will have. <br /> <br /> I wouldn't give psiads a dedicated Allegiance; they're too rare and too difficult to identify. Instead, they're spread out across all of the Allegiances, the same way that Talents are. On the other hand, I don't see why psiads wouldn't be able to engage in Super-Science; and IIRC the developers have stated that the term \u201cInspired\u201d does <i>not</i> apply exclusively to Talents. So it wouldn't surprise me if the Inspired genius who developed the Karnataka Process was in fact a psiad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"