"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1492135-tc-phoebe-trust-psions-in-modern-times?p=1492375#post1492375\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Psiad that lives in India specifically. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I sense a proxy feeling there\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe Sara Bhurano!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-05T13:40:51-07:00","id":1492391,"title":"","content":"Are you guys gonna use the Phoebe Trust as an alternate reality or as like part of the secret history of the main TC reality? I could see it going both ways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-05T14:20:06-07:00","id":1492394,"title":"","content":"Whichever is chosen, there needs to be sidebars detailing Amethyst's alternative idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-05T14:59:17-07:00","id":1492397,"title":"","content":"Now how many Psions do you think are linked to Phoebe Trust in a way it remains a secret?<br /> <br /> I would make the number relatively low, a 30-50 first generation, a 2-3 hundred second generation and a about a hundred third generation.<br /> <br /> The first generation are few because they have this tendency of self hurting to extend their powers in a way they don\u2019t recover with psi. Also because they are old, like 30+ years since their powers were triggered, so at least 40+ If they were experimenting on kids.<br /> <br /> Second generation are the most common because drugs. It can kill people, it can be extremely addictive, if not for the same reason as recreational drugs, for the power you gain with it, but drugs are easier to minister and deliver than brain surgeries.<br /> <br /> Third generation are more common than first, but not as second, mainly because they are new and takes quite a long time to make one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a hr